0.0770.15[0151] By means of the invention, the guiding of the robot is improved when the robot has to be guided, at least partially, by hand.

[0156] During a step S104 ,the control system 8 calculates, in the impedance manager 46 implemented by the central unit 5, the composite setpoint u defining articular forces and velocities, according to the target trajectory and to the operating mode. [0157] During a step S106, the control system 8 calculates, in the impedance manager 46 implemented by the central unit 5, the behavior matrix Y according to the operating mode. [0158] During a step S108, the control system 8 calculates, in the impedance controller 48 implemented by the auxiliary unit 7, the articular force setpoint - and the time derivative qmvSVG
